00:06:57.785 --> 00:06:58.040
KAMI MAY: Yes.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.440
MARK MIRCHANDANI: --from
their old cell phones,

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.580
but now taken up a
notch with multiplayer.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:02.817
KAMI MAY: In 3D graphics.

00:07:02.817 --> 00:07:05.150
JON FOUST: I can imagine with
these specific game modes,

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.692
especially with a
Battle Royale mode,

00:07:06.692 --> 00:07:10.735
there's probably a need for
